    "summary": "Errata replacing the Effect of [Warp Stalkers](vsdata:ability/world-eaters.possessed-slaughterband.warp-stalkers). Until the phase ends, whenever one of your unit's models makes a **Normal move**, **Advance move**, **Fall Back move** or **Charge move**, it may pass through enemy models other than **MONSTERS** and **VEHICLES**. When it does:\n\n- it may enter the **Engagement Range** of those models, but only a Charge move may end there\n- every **Desperate Escape** test it must take is passed automatically",
